    <section class="section section-dark"><div class="container split-intro"><div><p class="eyebrow">Public benefit</p><h2>Useful knowledge without a sales pitch.</h2></div><div><p>Navio Pathways is organized around youth education and community benefit. The website contains no advertising, affiliate links, paid placement offers, or commercial lead generation. Core career resources are available in HTML at no charge, so students, families, and educators can use them without downloading a file or creating an account.</p><p>Workshop speakers contribute practical perspective. Their participation does not constitute an endorsement, partnership, job offer, or individualized career advice.</p></div></div></section>
