    <section class="section"><div class="container opportunity-grid"><article class="info-card status-current"><p class="eyebrow">Available now</p><h2>Career resources</h2><p>Three original, step-by-step guides are available in HTML without registration: career research, professional conversations, and decision reflection.</p><a class="text-link" href="/resources/">Use the resources <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></article><article class="info-card status-scheduled"><p class="eyebrow">Schedule publishing</p><h2>Online career-awareness workshops</h2><p>The full program model is public. Confirmed session dates, duration, capacity, and registration deadlines will appear on the workshop page before applications are accepted.</p><a class="text-link" href="/career-workshops/">Review the workshop <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></article></div></section>
